cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Callo in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Callosum: Bridging System One and Deep Work"
abstract: >-
  Callosum (Callo, the Python package and command `callo`) bridges quick decisions and deep work on the model you
  already serve: a small server in front of llama-server that answers System One classification requests from the
  same model your agent runs, on reserved slots, with optional think budgets and calibration.
authors:
  - given-names: Saga
    family-names: Ishtardottir
version: 0.3.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/peculiar-ragdoll/callosum"
url: "https://github.com/peculiar-ragdoll/callosum"
keywords:
  - llama.cpp
  - classification
  - decision models
  - System One
  - LLM serving
